bout Mark Cuban has appeared on the Lew Rockwell blog.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;According to the article, he is involved in a company involved in facial recognition hardware/software.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5293905684305349743'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5293905684305349743'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1279678289980#c5293905684305349743' title=''/><author><name>CycleTimeChart</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17479869037491765636</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1201210367"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 20, 2010 at 8:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8445079757714537640</id><published>2009-01-10T16:09:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2009-01-10T16:09:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Hang in there Mark and keep fighting!Steven Wevoda...</title><content type='html'>Hang in there Mark and keep fighting!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Steven Wevodau&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.stevenwevodau.info</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/8445079757714537640'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http:/