 Combatant</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03394684909364035530</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='17' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_gBAl13cUq_E/SVAEK1ue4zI/AAAAAAAAAAM/j-tU_aVQFb8/S220/American+Combatant_7.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-91821325"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 29, 2008 at 5:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3648351720765647885</id><published>2008-11-21T15:43:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-21T15:43:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Sweet. You are most excellent wordsmith on this fa...</title><content type='html'>Sweet. You are most excellent wordsmith on this farce. All hail both Cuban and Grigg!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I also noted this link&lt;BR/&gt;http://www.davemanuel.com/2007/08/07/think-that-the-sec-is-corrupt-meet-gary-aguirre/&lt;BR/&gt;on my own blog. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;When we&#39;re done with the SEC, let&#39;s all go after Rep. (now Senator - gasp!) Mark Udall&#39;s useless fed dept, &quot;The Federal Office of Space Commerce.&quot; I mean, for crying out loud....&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thanks a bunch to proLibertate!!!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/3648351720765647885'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/3648351720765647885'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227307380000#c3648351720765647885' title=''/><author><name>Michelle Fire Eater</name><uri>http://blogoffire.wordpress.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 21, 2008 at 3:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1107870328484693390</id><published>2008-11-21T14:09:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-21T14:09:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>personal note to Will:Have as blessed a Holiday as...</title><content type='html'>personal note to Will:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Have as blessed a Holiday as you can.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;May you have many more.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Doc</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/1107870328484693390'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/1107870328484693390'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227301740000#c1107870328484693390' title=''/><author><name>Doc Ellis 124</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08543939658083915285</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='30' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_1kwNGyaGlXM/SJS8lW2chPI/AAAAAAAAACM/qg-P4Z07IBI/S220/Doc+166+x+177.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1989478426"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 21, 2008 at 2:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4005653865037098248</id><published>2008-11-21T14:04:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-21T14:04:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Lee at 3.53: &quot;It&#39;s easier for the feds to go after...</title><content type='html'>Lee at 3.53: &quot;It&#39;s easier for the feds to go after someone everyone thinks is obnoxious. Look at what they did to Martha Stewart.&quot;  Excuse me?  More like look what they did to the Mongols MC.  The feds stole the group&#39;s IT through a court order.  They did this in October.  Now they&#39;re going after Cuban.  Stewart was not obnoxious, just cloying.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Doc Ellis 124</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/4005653865037098248'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/4005653865037098248'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227301440000#c4005653865037098248' title=''/><author><name>Doc Ellis 124</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08543939658083915285</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='30' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_1kwNGyaGlXM/SJS8lW2chPI/AAAAAAAAACM/qg-P4Z07IBI/S220/Doc+166+x+177.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1989478426"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 21, 2008 at 2:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8351097964866934166</id><published>2008-11-20T01:55:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-20T01:55:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>When I heard about Mark Cuban being prosecuted, hi...</title><content type='html'>When I heard about Mark Cuban being prosecuted, his exchange with Bill O&#39;Reilly was the first thing that I thought of.  When you include his support for BailoutSleuth.com it makes the prosecution even more odious!  Do &quot;they&quot; really think that their motives aren&#39;t obvious, or have the &quot;authorities&quot; dispensed with all pretext of even trying to fake being legitimate?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/8351097964866934166'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/8351097964866934166'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227171300000#c8351097964866934166' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 20, 2008 at 1:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5331823697920108015</id><published>2008-11-19T19:16:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-19T19:16:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>My favorite novel-to-film adaptation, and one all ...</title><content type='html'>My favorite novel-to-film adaptation, and one all too applicable to our situation, is the movie version of George Orwell&#39;s &quot;1984&quot;. I&#39;ve never seen a movie so true to the book.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5331823697920108015'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5331823697920108015'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227147360000#c5331823697920108015' title=''/><author><name>The Omega Man</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 19, 2008 at 7:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5705708127434161172</id><published>2008-11-19T18:49:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-19T18:49:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Boy, this government is out of control. I&#39;m gettin...</title><content type='html'>Boy, this government is out of control. I&#39;m getting nervous. The criminal actions of the government aren&#39;t even being hidden anymore-it&#39;s gone totally rogue. And as far as &quot;absurd conspiracy theories&quot; go, scratch the theory part. The wtc towers were NOT brought down by fire alone. Granted, I have an engineering back ground, but how is it the layman cannot see that wtc 7 was imploded?  There is no theory about it: there was a successful conspiracy to bring down the buildings to make it easier for the corporate empire to expand.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5705708127434161172'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5705708127434161172'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227145740000#c5705708127434161172' title=''/><author><name>zach</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 19, 2008 at 6:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3645851730982435881</id><published>2008-11-19T18:16:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-19T18:16:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;. . . empurpled with outrage&quot;: brilliant!</title><content type='html'>&quot;. . . empurpled with outrage&quot;: brilliant!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/3645851730982435881'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/3645851730982435881'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227143760000#c3645851730982435881' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 19, 2008 at 6:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2303934273676787457</id><published>2008-11-19T17:07:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-19T17:07:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I am sure, now that the election is over, Jeffrey ...</title><content type='html'>I am sure, now that the election is over, Jeffrey Norris will now busy himself hymning new praises to the newest Emperor to take the throne. All he needs to do is replace the name GW Bush with Barack Obama and he will officially be in good graces. My how low people will stoop for a paycheck.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/679954175363292008