isplayTime" value="November 18, 2008 at 5:22 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2475524804876129085</id><published>2008-11-18T16:53:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-18T16:53:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It&#39;s easier for the feds to go after someone every...</title><content type='html'>It&#39;s easier for the feds to go after someone everyone thinks is obnoxious. Look at what they did to Martha Stewart. Unfortunately, most Americans are more concerned about who&#39;s going to win &lt;I&gt;Dancing with the Stars&lt;/I&gt; than our nation&#39;s slide into outright fascism.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/2475524804876129085'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/2475524804876129085'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227052380000#c2475524804876129085' title=''/><author><name>Lee Shelton IV</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11254842261338255019</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='28' src='http://www.evervigilant.net/images/calvin_face10.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-282081141"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 18, 2008 at 4:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5596659912417433466</id><published>2008-11-18T15:32:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-18T15:32:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Kuddos to Cuban!  I did&#39;nt know such a person exsi...</title><content type='html'>Kuddos to Cuban!  I did&#39;nt know such a person exsisted.  I will have to research him.  Stand up for truth dude!&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I got a battle raging right now with a real corrupt dude and since been arrested for trying to buy a parking sticker.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5596659912417433466'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/5596659912417433466'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227047520000#c5596659912417433466' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 18, 2008 at 3:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6853817282397739754</id><published>2008-11-18T14:14:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-18T14:14:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Excellent post. Not a fan of Ayn Rand, but a well ...</title><content type='html'>Excellent post. Not a fan of Ayn Rand, but a well stated and informative defense of Cuban. He is a bit obnoxious, and is obviously being persecuted for doing the right thing.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/6853817282397739754'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6799541753632920086/comments/default/6853817282397739754'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html?showComment=1227042840000#c6853817282397739754' title=''/><author><name>arevolutionofone</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08933491715460397840</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='30' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_-rGRpP7nxRo/R9qS2qbZ_GI/AAAAAAAAAIw/G54Xc7z6v2Y/S220/profilepic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/11/free-mark-cuban.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6799541753632920086' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6799541753632920086' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2048530472"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 18, 2008 at 2:14 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6702419994248253007</id><published>2008-11-18T12:02:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-11-18T12:02:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>That IS another very worthy selection, robin.Anoth...</title><content type='html'>That IS another very worthy selection, robin.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Another example of a very different kind would be the novel-to-film adaptation of Ian Fleming&#39;s &quot;On Her Majesty&#39;s Secret Service,&quot; which is my favorite Bond film. The movie takes minimal liberties with the plot, dialogue, and characterization (although Blofeld in the film is a more thuggish character than he was in the book).</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='